<article class="env-definition" id="0AJ7">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0AJ7">Definition <span data-tag="0AJ7">87.16.3</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be a formal algebraic space over $S$. We say </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$X$ is <em>quasi-separated</em> if the equivalent conditions of Lemma <a href="/tag/0AJ5" data-tag="0AJ5">87.16.1</a> are satisfied. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$X$ is <em>separated</em> if the equivalent conditions of Lemma <a href="/tag/0AJ6" data-tag="0AJ6">87.16.2</a> are satisfied. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
